e knows what works  he knows what angles work he knows not  only what you need but most importantly  what you don't need  um you know and i think that's actually  you know that's that's the strength of  somebody who comes from that kind of  background  um they just you know he has incredible  style  and i think you know he and kate really  had such respect for one another because  they both wanted they both wanted they  wanted the action and the drama  and the drama to they wanted the  dramatic  story the emotion of the story to  actually inform  the action set pieces and that's when  you get the most  you know gritty fun to watch stuff  um and then that comes from him from  darren being a performer for sure  thank you so much for your time have a  great day thank you

